      "content": "It means you control the *quality* of the waiting, not the fact of it. You can choose to let the panic and the despair consume you, becoming a passive victim of the deluge. Or, you can choose to focus on the smallest thing that is still yours—a small act of self-preservation, a moment of intense focus, or simply deciding *how* you will meet the inevitable. That conscious decision, even in the face of ruin, is where the power, and the final dignity, resides.",
